# Baseline security headers. No CSP here: this site runs mostly inline
# <script> across every page (no build step), so a script-src strict enough
# to matter would need a nonce/hash on every inline block to avoid breaking
# the site — not attempted here. These headers cost nothing to add and don't
# depend on enumerating every external resource the site loads.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains

# Cloudflare Pages: always revalidate our own scripts, so a deploy reaches returning
# visitors immediately (the default is a 4 hour browser cache).
/js/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
